{"id":"50123b27e10d65fc","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-mindnfuniq.md","title":"Essential-prime condition for unique prime minimum DNF","display":"thm-mindnfuniq — Essential-prime condition for unique prime minimum DNF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-mindnfuniq","aliases":["27-thm-mindnfuniq"],"display":"thm-mindnfuniq — Essential-prime condition for unique prime minimum DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-df-corepi]]","[[27-df-mindnf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§3.3.2 Definition 3.3; direct consequence for prime minimum covers","source_printed_pages":"146","source_pdf_pages":"170","verification_status":"proved-in-note-from-source-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-mindnfuniq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-mindnfuniq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mindnfuniq — Essential-prime condition for unique prime minimum DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c417c668c09a97ed\" href=\"?note=c417c668c09a97ed\" title=\"27-df-corepi\">27-df-corepi</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25e15a85dc4e265d\" href=\"?note=25e15a85dc4e265d\" title=\"27-df-mindnf\">27-df-mindnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.2 Definition 3.3; direct consequence for prime minimum covers"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"146"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"170"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-from-source-definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c417c668c09a97ed\" href=\"?note=c417c668c09a97ed\" title=\"27-df-corepi\">27-df-corepi</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25e15a85dc4e265d\" href=\"?note=25e15a85dc4e265d\" title=\"27-df-mindnf\">27-df-mindnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)=\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)=\\{\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}(f)=\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)=\\{\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 prime 表示都须包含每个 essential prime；若所有 prime 都 essential，则 prime 表示只能是全部 prime 的集合，故它唯一且最优。旧结论错误地使用 unrestricted MinDNF：f=x₁∨x₂ 时 {x₁,x₂} 与 {x₁,¬x₁x₂} 都只有两项。修正保持唯一“prime 最小表示”的原意，新增 prime 限制而非任意削弱。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-corepi","status":"resolved","id":"c417c668c09a97ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-corepi]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mindnf","status":"resolved","id":"25e15a85dc4e265d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-mindnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$、$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-corepi]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-mindnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-corepi","status":"resolved","id":"c417c668c09a97ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$、$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-corepi]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-mindnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mindnf","status":"resolved","id":"25e15a85dc4e265d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$、$\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-corepi]]，$\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-mindnf]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)=\\mathrm{CorePI}(f)\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)=\\{\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1503,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-462","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-mindnfuniq|thm-mindnfuniq — Essential-prime condition for unique prime minimum DNF]]"}],"outgoing":["3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","c417c668c09a97ed","25e15a85dc4e265d"]}